Z||000006||DRH||01-19-2001||04:53 PM||||Experience (and good tires) has a lot to do with it. The guy driving the Shelby here has been auto-xing for 10 or 15 years. In that car for most of that... REAL smooth runs...<P>I bought an 85 Shelby new and had it for 4 years. I never did any formal racing with it but I'd say it's REAL close in performance  to my 88 Formula I got 2 years ago. You have to drive them different but can get close to the same results. In pure stock form that is... I think Fieros have MUCH more potential for improvement...||||reg||1
